# Local archive of archived code at repo root only (see archive/backend-multi-module-2026-06/).
# Not for commit — git history already preserves the old sources.
# Leading slash scopes this to the repo root so `openspec/changes/archive/`
# (used by the OpenSpec `archive` command) can still be tracked.
/archive/

